[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/5136214696","html_url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/issues/711#issuecomment-5136214696","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/711","id":5136214696,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFhfz288AAAABMiRqqA","user":{"login":"muzimuzhi","id":6376638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzY2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6376638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muzimuzhi","html_url":"https://github.com/muzimuzhi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muzimuzhi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muzimuzhi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muzimuzhi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muzimuzhi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muzimuzhi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muzimuzhi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muzimuzhi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muzimuzhi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muzimuzhi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T20:59:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T21:20:03Z","body":"> For anyone landing here, `-ignore` scoped to this single message keeps the rest of the linting intact:\n> \n> actionlint -ignore 'specifying action \"\\$/.+\" in invalid format because ref is missing'\n\nSimilarly, the `paths.<path-glob>.ignore` [config setting](https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/blob/main/docs/config.md):\n\n```yaml\npaths:\n  .github/workflows/**/*.{yaml,yml}:\n    ignore:\n      - reusable workflow call \"\\$/.+\" at \"uses\" is not following the format\n      - specifying action \"\\$/.+\" in invalid format because ref is missing\n```\n\n_Update:_ Added `ignore` config for `$/` self-reference reusable workflows.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/5136214696/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":16,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/5568634272","html_url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/issues/711#issuecomment-5568634272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/711","id":5568634272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFhfz288AAAABS-qdoA","user":{"login":"silverwind","id":115237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTIzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverwind","html_url":"https://github.com/silverwind","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverwind/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverwind/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverwind/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverwind/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverwind/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverwind/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverwind/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverwind/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverwind/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-07T09:37:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T09:39:07Z","body":"This is needed, when running `zizmor` together with this linter, the linters disagree and zizmor wants `$/` syntax while actions lint does not support it and fails with `specifying action \"\\$/.+\" in invalid format because ref is missing`. This came in https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor/pull/2271.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/5568634272/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/6492257723","html_url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/issues/711#issuecomment-6492257723","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/711","id":6492257723,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFhfz288AAAABgvf9uw","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-29T08:52:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:52:45Z","body":"Confirmed with the current stable 1.7.12 Docker distribution at `rhysd/actionlint@sha256:b1934ee5f1c509618f2508e6eb47ee0d3520686341fec936f3b79331f9315667` during https://github.com/link-foundation/meta-sovereign/pull/55. Runner 2.338.0 successfully resolves and executes `uses: $/.github/actions/npm-cache`, while actionlint rejects the same reference as missing a ref.\n\nMinimal reproduction:\n\n```yaml\nname: Self-reference\non: workflow_dispatch\njobs:\n  check:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-24.04\n    steps:\n      - uses: $/.github/actions/npm-cache\n```\n\nRun the pinned image against this workflow: the valid reference produces `[action] specifying action ... in invalid format because ref is missing`.\n\nOur temporary workaround uses `paths` to ignore only that exact action reference/diagnostic in its two calling workflow files. A separate contract verifies that the referenced action exists. A real bundled-checker rehearsal confirms a different invalid reference and a genuine ShellCheck SC2086 still fail; no global action/shell rule is disabled. The exception has an explicit removal condition when support ships.\n\nSuggested implementation: recognize `$/<nonempty-relative-path>` as a distinct same-repository reference before remote `owner/repo@ref` validation, preserve validation of malformed/empty paths, and add action/composite/reusable-workflow cases. The downstream reproducible positive/negative experiment is `experiments/issue-54/rehearse-actionlint.py` in the linked PR. No duplicate issue opened because this report already tracks the cause.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/6492257723/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/comments/6562198292","html_url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/issues/711#issuecomment-6562198292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/issues/711","id":6562198292,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFhfz288AAAABhyMzFA","user":{"login":"rsb-23","id":57601627,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjAxNjI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57601627?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsb-23","html_url":"https://github.com/rsb-23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsb-23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsb-23/following{/other_u